      "metadata": {
        "title": "A second event lies in the region labelled “elsewhere,” outside the origin’s light cone. How is it separated from the origin?",
        "license": "CC BY-NC-SA",
        "licenseVersion": "4.0",
        "contentType": "Multiple Choice"
      },
      "params": {
        "question": "<p>A second event lies in the region labelled “elsewhere,” outside the origin’s light cone. How is it separated from the origin?</p>",
        "media": {
          "type": {
            "library": "H5P.Image 1.1",
            "subContentId": "3ea040d8-e238-4697-a66a-6e98d6f6ca71",
            "metadata": {
              "title": "Spacetime diagram showing the future and past light cones, timelike regions inside them, and spacelike regions outside them.",
              "license": "CC BY-NC-SA",
              "licenseVersion": "4.0",
              "contentType": "Image"
            },
            "params": {
              "contentName": "Image",
              "alt": "Spacetime diagram showing the future and past light cones, timelike regions inside them, and spacelike regions outside them.",
              "decorative": false,
              "file": {
                "path": "images/ch02-light-cone.svg",
                "mime": "image/svg+xml",
                "width": 700,
                "height": 430
              }
            }
          },
          "disableImageZooming": false
        },
        "answers": [
          {
            "text": "<div>Spacelike: different inertial frames may reverse the event order, but no sub-light signal can connect the events.</div>",
            "correct": true,
            "tipsAndFeedback": {
              "tip": "",
              "chosenFeedback": "Yes—this is one of the correct choices.",
              "notChosenFeedback": ""
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "<div>Timelike: every inertial frame must agree that it occurs after the origin.</div>",
            "correct": false,
            "tipsAndFeedback": {
              "tip": "",
              "chosenFeedback": "Not this one. Revisit the chapter summary and try again.",
              "notChosenFeedback": ""
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "<div>Lightlike: only a light signal can connect it to the origin.</div>",
            "correct": false,
            "tipsAndFeedback": {
              "tip": "",
              "chosenFeedback": "Not this one. Revisit the chapter summary and try again.",
              "notChosenFeedback": ""
            }
          },
          {
            "text": "<div>Simultaneous in every inertial frame.</div>",
            "correct": false,
            "tipsAndFeedback": {
              "tip": "",
              "chosenFeedback": "Not this one. Revisit the chapter summary and try again.",
              "notChosenFeedback": ""
            }
          }
        ],
